jobs.description:
Do you enjoy working with your hands and have an interest in mechanics? Then this could be the perfect opportunity for you!

Previous experience is a plus, but your motivation, willingness to learn and technical curiosity are even more important. You will join an experienced team where the job is taught practically on the workshop floor.

Your Responsibilities include:


• Performing maintenance on trailers and semi-trailers;

• Preparing vehicles for technical inspections;

• Repairing minor technical defects and mechanical issues;

• Carrying out control and inspection activities;

• Reporting technical problems to colleagues or supervisors;

• Help maintain a safe and organized workshop environment.

Are you the Technician that we are looking for?


• Strong interest in mechanics and technical work;

• Hands-on mentality and practical mindset;

• Eager to learn and develop new technical skills;

• Comfortable performing repetitive tasks accurately;

• Good English;

 Previous experience as a technician, mechanic or maintenance worker is an advantage, but not required.
